ack (also an output) and the pedal jack.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:14px;padding:13px 20px;font-size:17px;background:#fff8e6\">All the connections are on the back panel, so plug in your headphones before you sit down.</div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Photo: Roland. Annotations: Pianoers</span><b>PIANOERS.COM</b></div></body></html>"], "roland-fp-10-dimensions": [700, "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Noto+Music&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{width:1200px;height:700px;font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6f7;color:#15191c;padding:52px 60px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.eyebrow{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2e6475}\nh1{font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:8px 0 26px}\n.foot{position:absolute;left:60px;right:60px;bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;color:#56666e;font-weight:500}\n.foot b{letter-spacing:.12em;color:#2e6475}\n.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e2e5;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(21 25 28/6%),0 8px 24px rgb(21 25 28/6%)}\nsvg text{font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.mus{font-family:\"Noto Music\",serif}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"eyebrow\">Size</div><h1>How big is the Roland FP-10?</h1><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:40px 70px 30px 40px\"><div style=\"position:relative\"><img src=\"file:///home/user/dt/pianoers/roland-fp-10-review/images/top-view.png\" style=\"width:100%;display:block\">\n<div style=\"position:absolute;right:-46px;top:0;bottom:0;width:2px;background:#2e6475\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;right:-56px;top:0;width:22px;height:2px;background:#2e6475\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;righ