/roland-fp-10-review/images/stand-kscfp10.png\" style=\"max-height:370px;max-width:100%\"></div><div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin-top:10px\">Dedicated stand (KSCFP10)</div><div style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.4\">Gives the FP-10 a furniture look. 20.0 kg (44 lb 2 oz) all together, with the music rest.</div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:20px\"><div style=\"height:380px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#fff\"><img src=\"file:///home/user/dt/pianoers/roland-fp-10-review/images/stand-legs.png\" style=\"max-height:370px;max-width:100%\"></div><div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin-top:10px\">A simple keyboard stand</div><div style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.4\">Lighter and easy to fold away, but less like a real piano.</div></div></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Photos: Roland</span><b>PIANOERS.COM</b></div></body></html>"]}